# NAPALM Getters Reference

| Function | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| get_arp_table | Get the ARP table from a device |
| get_bgp_neighbors | Get BGP neighbors |
| get_bgp_neighbors_detail | Detailed BGP neighbor info |
| get_config | Get device configuration |
| get_facts | Version, serial, vendor, model, uptime |
| get_interfaces | List interfaces |
| get_interfaces_ip | Interface IP addresses |
| get_lldp_neighbors | LLDP neighbors |
| get_lldp_neighbors_detail | LLDP neighbor details |
| get_mac_address_table | MAC table |
| get_ntp_servers | NTP info |
| get_route_to | Show route |
| get_snmp_information | SNMP info |
| is_alive | Connection check |
| ping | Ping from device |
